descriptions.job-10tdj0l:
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Founded 20 years ago and headquartered in Chicago, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Group of financial services firms has grown to more than 600 people operating throughout North America, Europe and Asia. Since spinning out of a large brokerage firm in 2016, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; Trading has rapidly scaled as an independent proprietary trading firm utilizing its own capital, trading strategies, and risk management methodologies to provide liquidity to worldwide financial markets and hedging opportunities to commodity producers and users. Now, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; group affiliates include two broker dealers, a cryptocurrency market making firm, and a bourgeoning investment adviser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Overview: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;DV is looking for a Senior Systems Engineer, working out of either our Chicago, New York, or London office, to join a growing IT organization that will help impact our Windows, virtualization, and cloud capabilities. In this role you will work on driving our core infrastructure forward, leveraging the latest and greatest technologies to help improve our IT operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support and maintain all data centers on the east coast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design, build and maintain Windows Server and Desktop environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design, build and maintain virtualization and cloud environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Leverage automation for deploying and supporting on-premises and cloud infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with the Security team on the design, implement, and support of our centralized identity and access management solution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with the Security team to ensure we are adhering to security best practices across all environments including patch remediation and system hardening&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Review and improve upon existing monitoring systems and process&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Perform Windows OS performance tuning&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Author and maintain computer system design documentation, diagrams, processes and procedures&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Promote and adopt Infrastructure as Code across all IT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be a mentor to junior IT staff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Participate in an on-call rotation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db73e6d3f6c4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Self-starter with a passion for technology and problem solving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience as a senior infrastructure engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge and practical implementation of Windows, virtualization, and cloud computing infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of Windows operating systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of virtualization technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience implementing and supporting identity platforms such as Azure AD and Active Directory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Knowledge of TCP/IP and multicast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Knowledge of scripting languages such as Powershell and Python&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Extensive experience configuration management systems such as Ansible, Salt, or Terraform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Extensive experience with endpoint management systems such as Microsoft Endpoint Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and written communication skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to present complex, technical ideas in a clear and concise manner to non-technical audiences&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db73e6d3f6c4&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;748&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1ac93e0b889c&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Discretionary bonus eligibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;HSA, FSA, and Dependent Care Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Employer Paid Group Term Life and AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Voluntary LTD, Life &amp;amp; AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible Vacation policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Retirement plan with employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is not accepting unsolicited resumes from search firms. Only search firms with valid, written agreements with &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; should submit resumes in response to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;’s posted positions. All resumes submitted by search firms to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; via e-mail, the Internet, personal delivery, facsimile, or any other method without a valid written agreement shall be deemed the sole property of &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The range below reflects the expected base salary for this position. It represents a good-faith estimate of the base pay we anticipate offering, with actual compensation determined by your experience, education, skills, and performance throughout the interview process. This role is also eligible for a discretionary bonus (at DV Trading&#39;s discretion) and DV Trading&#39;s benefits package, including the benefits listed above.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0pnds3p:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a 12-week internship during summer 2027.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the Acceleration Programs team within the Talent Density pillar of our People Team, which works to cultivate a culture that attracts, recognizes, and accelerates top talent. As an intern, you&#39;ll align with one or more critical projects that support our number one operating priority: top talent in every seat. You&#39;ll flex program design, project management, and analytical skills while contributing to work that unlocks employees&#39; ability to have a major impact at Coinbase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support program design by actively contributing to brainstorms, working sessions, and development of project plans, timelines, and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Talent Density team members and cross-functional People Team partners to execute program logistics end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and analyze feedback from various sources to assess program effectiveness and contribute actionable recommendations for future iterations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain documentation for new and existing processes to ensure scalability and clear communication across stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing a project from initial concept to completion, including setting timelines and tracking deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and problem-solving capability with a data-driven approach to decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizational skills sufficient to balance multiple priorities and meet deadlines in a remote environment without close oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication with the ability to collaborate effectively across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
