descriptions.job-1yvh3t1:
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;Founded 20 years ago and headquartered in Chicago, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Group of financial services firms has grown to more than 600 people operating throughout North America, Europe and Asia. Since spinning out of a large brokerage firm in 2016, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; Trading has rapidly scaled as an independent proprietary trading firm utilizing its own capital, trading strategies, and risk management methodologies to provide liquidity to worldwide financial markets and hedging opportunities to commodity producers and users. Now, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; group affiliates include two broker dealers, a cryptocurrency market making firm, and a bourgeoning investment adviser.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Overview: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;We are building out the next generation of our proprietary electronic trading platform — a greenfield, event-based trading and market data system covering pricing, execution, and risk management — and we are looking for a senior C++ engineer to help lead that effort. You will design and build the systems our trading desks depend on every day: ultra-low-latency execution engines, market data pipelines, order and risk management, and direct connectivity to the world’s major futures and commodities exchanges. This is a hands-on senior role on a small team with broad ownership across the trading stack — the code you write goes to production and trades real markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Lead the design, implementation, and deployment of DV Commodities&#39; core C++ trading platform: execution, order management, market data, pricing, and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Design and maintain direct exchange connectivity — order entry gateways and feed handlers for venues such as CME (iLink 3 / MDP 3.0), ICE, and other futures and commodities markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Drive microsecond- and nanosecond-level performance work: lock-free data structures, cache-aware design, kernel-bypass networking, CPU pinning and NUMA tuning, and rigorous latency measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Work directly with trading desks on new feature requests, pricing, and execution algos, and with quants and developers on cross-functional teams to troubleshoot and solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Build high-performance components for both simulation and live trading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Own systems end to end — design, implementation, testing, deployment, and production support in a live trading environment.&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db73e6d3f6c4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional C++ development, with deep command of modern C++ (17/20), templates, move semantics, memory models, and concurrency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building low-latency, high-throughput, multi-threaded systems for quantitative trading — ideally at a proprietary trading firm, market maker, hedge fund, or exchange.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of how exchanges work: order types, matching engine behavior, market microstructure, and native exchange protocols (e.g., iLink/MDP, native ICE, FIX/SBE).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with futures and/or commodities markets; energy markets (crude, refined products, natural gas) and swaps a strong plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems-level fluency: Linux/Unix environments, git, TCP/UDP and multicast networking, kernel-bypass stacks (Onload, VMA, DPDK, or similar), and performance profiling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with distributed systems, large data sets, and SQL, NoSQL, or tick databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to program in a scientific computing environment (Python/NumPy/pandas) for research and tooling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills; sound judgment in production trading environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher in CS, Engineering, or another technical discipline, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is not accepting unsolicited resumes from search firms. Only search firms with valid, written agreements with &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; should submit resumes in response to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;’s posted positions. All resumes submitted by search firms to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; via e-mail, the Internet, personal delivery, facsimile, or any other method without a valid written agreement shall be deemed the sole property of &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-0ksxoat:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is building economic infrastructure for the internet. We help organizations of every size move money, manage revenue, and build global financial services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Public Sector team builds Stripe’s presence in markets where organizations deliver essential services to millions of people. In the UK, public sector organizations collect taxes and tuition, enable transit, distribute funds, support charitable giving, and modernize citizen services. The team helps these organizations improve how they collect, manage, and disburse funds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the UK Public Sector Lead, you will build and lead Stripe’s public sector go-to-market motion in the UK. You will define how Stripe serves central government, local government, devolved administrations, public bodies, higher education, utilities, transport, charities and not-for-profit organizations, and adjacent regulated organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will combine market knowledge, commercial judgment, and operational leadership to build trusted relationships, win meaningful business, and establish the operating model needed to serve public sector customers. This role reports to the Global Head of Public Sector and will help launch Stripe’s UK public sector motion in 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define Stripe’s UK public sector strategy, including priority segments, customer problems,&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; routes to market, commercial opportunities, and the capabilities needed to succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships across government, public bodies, procurement ecosystems, industry associations, systems integrators, and advisory partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior customer decision-makers to understand their payment, revenue, digital service, and financial infrastructure needs, and develop solutions with Stripe teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide strategic opportunities through public sector procurement, contracting, security, compliance, and stakeholder alignment requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal, Compliance, Risk, Go-to-Market, Alliances and Channels, Product, Engineering, Finance, and Operations to prepare Stripe to support public sector customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn recurring market requirements into priorities for onboarding, risk, contracting, procurement, implementation, support, and product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the positioning, account strategy, partner ecosystem, sales plays, internal processes, and success metrics that support growth in the UK and inform Stripe’s global public sector strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in or selling to the UK public sector, including government, public bodies, education, transport, utilities, charities and not-for-profit organizations, or other regulated institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established senior relationships across the UK public sector, its partner ecosystem, and relevant procurement or policy communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering complex outcomes across multiple stakeholders and working through public sector procurement, contracting, compliance, risk, and implementation requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading senior cross-functional stakeholders across Legal, Compliance, Risk, Product, Sales, Partnerships, and Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, strategic judgment, and experience working directly on market-building initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching a product, organization, market, vertical, or strategic go-to-market motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in payments, financial services, enterprise software, digital transformation, or platform technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with UK public procurement frameworks and common contracting vehicles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with systems integrators, consulting firms, implementation partners, or public sector technology ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning customer and regulatory requirements into scalable products, processes, or commercial models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-0rdf0at:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Work from anywhere, impact everywhere&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity is at the heart of who we are at Xapo Bank. &lt;br&gt;We’re a fully distributed team of over 160 Xapiens that work remotely from 50+ countries around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our beginning: A world that enjoys economic freedom and wealth protection,no matter where you live or who is running your country.&lt;br&gt;To achieve that, we search the world for the best people for the job. &lt;br&gt;We work hard, think globally, and inspire each other to learn and grow. &lt;br&gt;We are committed to changing the way things are done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Although we are headquartered in Gibraltar, this is a full time, 100% remote position&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Work from anywhere!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Position overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Treasury AVP at Xapo Bank, you will be a key member of our Treasury team, responsible for driving the Bank&#39;s Bitcoin first strategy along with focus on traditional finance, in particular across fixed income investment strategies that balance yield enhancement with prudent risk taking. Working closely with the Head of Treasury, you will bring a trading mindset to Treasury, structuring products across both traditional fixed income and Bitcoin, while leveraging strong Bitcoin and FX experience to support the Bank&#39;s investment and hedging activities. &lt;br&gt;If you are a commercially minded finance professional who thrives on designing creative, risk-aware solutions at the intersection of traditional finance and Bitcoin, we invite you to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Income Investments: Manage and grow the Treasury&#39;s fixed income investment portfolio, including sourcing, evaluating, and executing investments to optimise returns within approved risk limits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Reward Balance: Assess and balance risk and reward across Treasury&#39;s investment and structuring activities, ensuring decisions are made within the Group&#39;s Risk Appetite and Financial Limits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Structuring: Structure investment and yield products for Treasury, working with internal stakeholders and counterparties to bring new structured solutions to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bitcoin Structured Products: Design and structure products referencing Bitcoin, including yield, hedging, and investment structures that align with the Bank&#39;s Bitcoin-first strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OTC Bitcoin &amp;amp; FX Execution: Execute and manage OTC Bitcoin trades and FX flows, maintaining strong counterparty relationships and ensuring best execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trading Support: Apply trading discipline and market experience to Treasury&#39;s day-to-day investment, hedging, and execution activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Management: Identify and mitigate investment-related risks, including credit, market, currency, and interest rate risk, in line with the Group&#39;s Risk Appetite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treasury Reporting: Contribute to Treasury Management Information, including investment performance, P&amp;amp;L, and risk reporting for senior committees such as the ALCO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Skills needed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CFA or CIMA or similar qualification preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in Fixed Income Investments, including sourcing, evaluating, and managing a fixed income portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience structuring products for Treasury, ideally including Bitcoin-referenced structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong OTC Bitcoin and FX trading/flow experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a Trading role, with a strong understanding of market execution and price discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of risk-reward trade-offs, with the ability to balance yield enhancement against the Group&#39;s Risk Appetite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative, commercially minded approach to designing new investment and yield-enhancing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have Crypto experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Expertise: Strong understanding of financial principles, investment management, and treasury operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical Skills: Excellent quantitative and analytical abilities to interpret financial data and make data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Management: Knowledge of investment and market-related risks and experience in developing risk mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Strong verbal and written communication skills to report and present financial information effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to Detail: A high level of attention to detail and accuracy in financial calculations and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Other requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dedicated workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reliable internet connection with the fastest speed possible in your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment with Our Values and the Xapo Values-Driven Leadership principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Why work for Xapo?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Impact Globally, Work Remotely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Future&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improve lives through cutting-edge technology, work 100% remotely from anywhere in the world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great work-life balance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Build amazing things with a balance of autonomy and collaborative teamwork. Set your own work schedule and make use of a flexible PTO plan when you need to recharge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expect Excellence&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Collaborate, learn, and grow with a high-performance team. Learn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt; how you learn best - from books to conferences, you’ll get a yearly budget for your individual learning and development goals.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Xapo, we prioritize consumer protection and adhere to regulatory requirements by ensuring that all Xapiens are accountable for upholding principles of fair treatment, transparency, and ethical conduct in their interactions with customers and stakeholders.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-006g5vp:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Principal Recruiter to join our Core Recruiting team within People Success. This team owns hiring across Coinbase&#39;s G&amp;amp;A, Customer Experience, EAA and IT, and you&#39;ll be responsible for owning full-lifecycle recruiting across your portfolio. Depending on business needs, you may also support product group hiring, so flexibility across talent markets is key.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll partner directly with senior leaders to deeply understand their talent needs, build strong pipelines, and drive process improvements that help the recruiting team scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full recruitment lifecycle from role intake through close for complex, senior-level searches across your Core portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build candidate pipelines through self-sourcing and competitive research, ensuring sufficient depth and quality at each stage to maintain hiring velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leaders across your client groups to translate hiring needs into effective search strategies and a strong candidate and interviewer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data integrity and use pipeline analytics to inform hiring efficiency, surface bottlenecks, and improve outcomes for your hiring teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement recruiting processes and pilot programs that help the team scale its impact across global markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of full-lifecycle recruiting experience in a technology company or similarly fast-paced, high-growth environment,&amp;nbsp;with demonstrated success closing competitive candidates across G&amp;amp;A and/or technical functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling recruiting processes across global markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge across the entire candidate lifecycle, from talent mapping and sourcing through interviewing and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven approach to pipeline management with the ability to translate recruiting metrics into strategic recommendations for stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position ID: P77768&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt; The target annual &lt;strong&gt;base&lt;/strong&gt; salary for this position can range as detailed below. Total compensation may&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;also include equity and bonus eligibility and benefits (including medical, dental, and vision).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$212,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$212,200 SGD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
