&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join Upstream Rehabilitation, you get the strength of a national network with the feel of a local clinic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
