descriptions.job-0vs041x:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ripple is growing, and we&#39;re looking to hire an experienced Senior Sales Manager, based in London to cover the BeNeLux market. This sales quota-carrying position is responsible for revenue generation through the direct sale of Ripple Custody to financial institutions, crypto natives and FinTechs. The ideal candidate lives and breathes customer centricity, is a sales hunter and has a passion for the digital asset industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate extensive knowledge of Ripple products, including Custody, Stablecoin and Payments, effectively communicating the value propositions to Financial Institutions and Crypto-Natives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate leads and secure sales bookings for Ripple products in Switzerland to achieve assigned sales quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategic plans and account tactics, guided by management, to nurture leads and foster relationships within assigned territories and accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct client site visits, deliver sales presentations, and perform product demonstrations to prospective clients, driving engagement and interest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate the smooth progression of leads through the sales process, including prospect qualification, needs assessment, solution presentation, and timely closure of deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate and up-to-date sales pipeline forecasts daily, ensuring timely and detailed reporting of sales activities and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years experience in a consultative sales role in technology and/or Financial Services industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in the Digital Assets and/or payments industry or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have a proven track record of successful sales to Financial Insitutions and Crypto-Natives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive relationships and strong knowledge within the Financial Services and Digital Asset industry in Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and desire to manage a territory independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional language skills advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and a proactive, collaborative approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Salesforce and other relevant industry tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
