&lt;li&gt;Experience working on Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of multi-threaded/multi-core programming paradigms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Object-oriented design and programming experience&lt;/li&gt;
